Scope notes
-----------
- The image is complete for the current OS: kernel, base system,
  AI services with shipped models/weights, and bundled runtimes are
  all linked into the OS image and enumerated above.
- Shipped models/weights are hand-authored prototype classifier
  weights; bundled runtimes are prototype format subsystems.
- Verified boot paths: QEMU virt platform kernel loader and ARM64
  UEFI (AAVMF) loading EFI/BOOT/BOOTAA64.EFI from the disk image.
- Install path: write dist/zenin-os-uefi.img to storage (or attach
  as a disk) on an ARM64 UEFI platform.

